  "scope": "A pinned local Qdrant open-source engine enforces its native JWT RBAC on two synthetic collections over TLS. A coarse read token reaches both owned collections. Two separate scoped tokens read and write their assigned collections. Missing credentials and opposite-collection reads and writes are denied. A scoped read token and scoped read/write token are denied a harmless collection-create management action without changing state; an explicit global manage JWT can create, inspect, and remove only that owned synthetic metadata object. The native endpoint compares an expired and a current signed credential with the same collection read grant.",
